Now that's in the book of Revelation as well.

667
00:55:14.000 --> 00:55:17.000
It's actually in the book of Revelation.

668
00:55:17.000 --> 00:55:21.000
And the fire from heaven is in the book of Revelation as well.

669
00:55:21.000 --> 00:55:22.000
Okay.

670
00:55:22.000 --> 00:55:27.000
He says the human race literally worships itself at this particular stage.

671
00:55:27.000 --> 00:55:28.000
You know.

672
00:55:28.000 --> 00:55:31.000
That's what I mean by everything is very close.

673
00:55:31.000 --> 00:55:32.000
Yeah.

674
00:55:32.000 --> 00:55:35.000
That's four billion people for two thirds of the earth.

675
00:55:35.000 --> 00:55:38.000
That's four billion people.

676
00:55:38.000 --> 00:55:43.000
So he'll use the water, the fire and the wind and many other things.

677
00:55:43.000 --> 00:55:47.000
Which will cause many upon many to die.

678
00:55:47.000 --> 00:55:50.000
Notice the many upon many.

679
00:55:50.000 --> 00:55:52.000
What fright, what horror, she said.

680
00:55:52.000 --> 00:55:55.000
I felt I was dying and seeing all these sorrowful scenes.

681
00:55:55.000 --> 00:55:59.000
I would have wanted to suffer anything to placate the Lord.

682
00:55:59.000 --> 00:56:03.000
And the Lord made himself seen for just a little, but who can say how?

683
00:56:03.000 --> 00:56:07.000
I said a few words to placate him, but he wouldn't listen to me.

684
00:56:07.000 --> 00:56:13.000
And he told me, my daughter, I can find no place left in which to rest in my creation.

685
00:56:13.000 --> 00:56:17.000
Now there is the revelation as to why chastisement is necessary.

686
00:56:17.000 --> 00:56:22.000
The Lord should be able to rest in the heart of every single one of us.

687
00:56:22.000 --> 00:56:29.000
And so if there are seven billion people on the planet, there should be seven billion dwelling places for the Lord.

688
00:56:29.000 --> 00:56:31.000
And he said, I can't find anywhere.

689
00:56:31.000 --> 00:56:35.000
So when he came in the incarnation, he had no place to rest his head.

690
00:56:35.000 --> 00:56:39.000
And he says, now he has no place to rest his head either.

691
00:56:39.000 --> 00:56:41.000
So let me rest in you.

692
00:56:41.000 --> 00:56:47.000
He's asking that of Louisa first and anybody else who will live in the divine will.

693
00:56:47.000 --> 00:56:50.000
And you rest in me.

694
00:56:50.000 --> 00:56:51.000
Okay?

695
00:56:51.000 --> 00:56:56.000
Now you rest in me, is that you surrender and lean on him completely.

696
00:56:56.000 --> 00:56:59.000
And then I love the last two words and keep quiet.

697
00:57:01.000 --> 00:57:05.000
Now, why is he saying keep quiet? Would you stop rebelling?

698
00:57:05.000 --> 00:57:09.000
Stop asking questions. Stop asking me, why do I do this?

699
00:57:09.000 --> 00:57:11.000
We go on and on about everything.

700
00:57:11.000 --> 00:57:12.000
I love it.

701
00:57:12.000 --> 00:57:16.000
Because what you're hearing here is Jesus is real.

702
00:57:16.000 --> 00:57:17.000
He's real.

703
00:57:17.000 --> 00:57:19.000
I love it. Keep quiet.

704
00:57:19.000 --> 00:57:22.000
I've underlined that with my pen as well.

705
00:57:22.000 --> 00:57:25.000
I just think it's brilliant.

706
00:57:25.000 --> 00:57:31.000
So April the 25th, Louisa suffers together with Jesus.

707
00:57:31.000 --> 00:57:36.000
He gives her all his sufferings and all of himself as gift.

708
00:57:36.000 --> 00:57:39.000
Now notice the two go together.

709
00:57:39.000 --> 00:57:42.000
We want all of him, but not all of his sufferings.

710
00:57:42.000 --> 00:57:44.000
Isn't that right?

711
00:57:44.000 --> 00:57:50.000
As I was in my usual state, I seemed to see blessed Jesus inside of me,

712
00:57:50.000 --> 00:57:54.000
all afflicted in the act of suffering, the crucifixion.

713
00:57:54.000 --> 00:57:58.000
And it seemed that I would suffer a little together with him.

714
00:57:58.000 --> 00:58:03.000
Then he told me, "My daughter, everything is yours.

715
00:58:03.000 --> 00:58:07.000
My sufferings and all of myself." You see?

716
00:58:07.000 --> 00:58:11.000
The bit that we don't like is that if we say, "Yes, Jesus, I want all of you."

717
00:58:11.000 --> 00:58:16.000
He says, "Well, that means the sufferings as well as the glory."

718
00:58:16.000 --> 00:58:18.000
Now St. Paul was very good.

719
00:58:18.000 --> 00:58:20.000
You find it in Philippians chapter 3.

720
00:58:20.000 --> 00:58:23.000
He said, "Yes, I want my participation in the passion."

721
00:58:23.000 --> 00:58:27.000
So that I can have my participation in the resurrection.

722
00:58:27.000 --> 00:58:32.000
He understood that most of us would prefer to sort of skip the passion

723
00:58:32.000 --> 00:58:34.000
and jump into the resurrection.

724
00:58:34.000 --> 00:58:37.000
So he says, "I give them to you as a gift."

725
00:58:37.000 --> 00:58:41.000
I've only one comment in my book, "Wow."

726
00:58:41.000 --> 00:58:47.000
And then he added, "My daughter, how many things creatures do against me,

727
00:58:47.000 --> 00:58:50.000
what a thirst for sins they have."

728
00:58:50.000 --> 00:58:53.000
Isn't that an extraordinary expression?

729
00:58:53.000 --> 00:58:55.000
What a thirst for blood.

730
00:58:55.000 --> 00:59:00.000
You see, he's hinting at the First World War now.

731
00:59:00.000 --> 00:59:05.000
I would want to do nothing but pour the bowels of the earth inside out

732
00:59:05.000 --> 00:59:07.000
to burn them all up.

733
00:59:07.000 --> 00:59:10.000
Because the only God can see the real evil that's on the earth.

734
00:59:10.000 --> 00:59:12.000
We only see a tiny bit.

735
00:59:12.000 --> 00:59:15.000
And Louisa said, "Lord, what are you saying?"

736
00:59:15.000 --> 00:59:18.000
She was told to keep quiet, but she doesn't, you know?

737
00:59:18.000 --> 00:59:21.000
And you told me that you're all mine

738
00:59:21.000 --> 00:59:23.000
and one who gives himself to somebody else

739
00:59:23.000 --> 00:59:25.000
is no longer the master of himself.

740
00:59:25.000 --> 00:59:27.000
I do not want you to do this.

741
00:59:27.000 --> 00:59:29.000
Who's doing who's will?

742
00:59:29.000 --> 00:59:31.000
Isn't it fantastic?

743
00:59:31.000 --> 00:59:34.000
Now even someone as high up, Louisa,

744
00:59:34.000 --> 00:59:37.000
makes the mistake of telling the Lord what to do.

745
00:59:37.000 --> 00:59:39.000
"You mustn't do it," she said.

746
00:59:39.000 --> 00:59:41.000
"We don't do that," she said.

747
00:59:41.000 --> 00:59:43.000
"We don't tell anybody not to do that."

748
00:59:43.000 --> 00:59:46.000
"If you want satisfaction from me,

749
00:59:46.000 --> 00:59:48.000
make me suffer whatever you want,

750
00:59:48.000 --> 00:59:50.000
for I am ready to do anything."

751
00:59:50.000 --> 00:59:51.000
Okay.

752
00:59:51.000 --> 00:59:55.000
So Louisa said, "I felt him within me

753
00:59:55.000 --> 00:59:58.000
as if I were keeping him bound,

754
00:59:58.000 --> 01:00:01.000
bound from what, from doing chastisements."

755
01:00:01.000 --> 01:00:05.000
And oftentimes he would repeat, "Let me do,

756
01:00:05.000 --> 01:00:07.000
for I can take no more.

757
01:00:07.000 --> 01:00:10.000
Let me do, for I can take no more."

758
01:00:10.000 --> 01:00:13.000
And I would repeat, "I do not want it, Lord.

759
01:00:13.000 --> 01:00:17.000
I do not want it. Who's will is being done?"

760
01:00:17.000 --> 01:00:19.000
Yeah.

761
01:00:19.000 --> 01:00:21.000
But as I was saying this,

762
01:00:21.000 --> 01:00:24.000
I felt my heart split with tenderness in admiring his goodness,

763
01:00:24.000 --> 01:00:27.000
so condescending to his sinful soul such as I.

764
01:00:27.000 --> 01:00:30.000
I could understand many things about the divine goodness,

765
01:00:30.000 --> 01:00:32.000
but I can't say them very well.

766
01:00:32.000 --> 01:00:33.000
Okay.

767
01:00:33.000 --> 01:00:37.000
So, is Louisa doing the wrong thing by saying,

768
01:00:37.000 --> 01:00:40.000
"I don't want it to happen, you're not going to do it?"

769
01:00:40.000 --> 01:00:44.000
The answer is no, because you see,

770
01:00:44.000 --> 01:00:50.000
if you surrender to God, God surrenders to you,

771
01:00:50.000 --> 01:00:52.000
there's only one will.

772
01:00:52.000 --> 01:00:54.000
Is that okay?

773
01:00:54.000 --> 01:00:55.000
No.

774
01:00:55.000 --> 01:00:59.000
And in higher volumes when Louisa wants to hold back

775
01:00:59.000 --> 01:01:05.000
and not stop him, our blessed mother will appear to her and say,

776
01:01:05.000 --> 01:01:08.000
"You don't let him do it, don't let him do it."

777
01:01:08.000 --> 01:01:13.000
The whole image of our blessed mother in these writings is fascinating,

778
01:01:13.000 --> 01:01:16.000
because she's the great intercessor for us,

779
01:01:16.000 --> 01:01:20.000
and she's the one who wants her children saved even if they have to suffer.

780
01:01:20.000 --> 01:01:24.000
You know, so Louisa is not doing the wrong thing.

781
01:01:24.000 --> 01:01:27.000
It only appears that way on a surface reading.

782
01:01:27.000 --> 01:01:28.000
Okay.

783
01:01:28.000 --> 01:01:32.000
That's one of the reasons why we need to just discuss the readings.

784
01:01:32.000 --> 01:01:38.000
St. Augustine's fourth century said,

785
01:01:38.000 --> 01:01:41.000
"Love God and do it you like."

786
01:01:41.000 --> 01:01:43.000
And it's completely misunderstood,

787
01:01:43.000 --> 01:01:46.000
because people are reading it at a wrong level.

788
01:01:46.000 --> 01:01:50.000
Because if you love God and you have taken on God's love,

789
01:01:50.000 --> 01:01:53.000
then what you're doing is what God wants.

790
01:01:53.000 --> 01:01:56.000
Louisa's intentions are pure.

791
01:01:56.000 --> 01:01:57.000
Absolutely.

792
01:01:57.000 --> 01:02:00.000
But apart from the purity of intention,

793
01:02:00.000 --> 01:02:04.000
it's to know that she's not actually going against His will.

794
01:02:04.000 --> 01:02:07.000
It's part of the intercession thing.

795
01:02:07.000 --> 01:02:09.000
And what Louisa is saying here,

796
01:02:09.000 --> 01:02:13.000
you'll hear Jesus saying in "Get Seminy" in your hours of the Passion,

797
01:02:13.000 --> 01:02:16.000
and you'll hear him saying it on the cross, saying,

798
01:02:16.000 --> 01:02:18.000
"Father, you know, aren't you satisfied?"

799
01:02:18.000 --> 01:02:24.000
Yes, I mean, you know, don't go on with this.

800
01:02:24.000 --> 01:02:25.000
You know, can't you look at me?

801
01:02:25.000 --> 01:02:26.000
I'm your son and all this.

802
01:02:26.000 --> 01:02:29.000
She's actually doing to Jesus what Jesus did to the Father.

803
01:02:29.000 --> 01:02:36.000
And by the time Louisa wrote the hours of the Passion,

804
01:02:36.000 --> 01:02:41.000
she hadn't written one sentence of any of these volumes.

805
01:02:41.000 --> 01:02:42.000
Yeah.

806
01:02:42.000 --> 01:02:44.000
And she wrote the hours of the Passion years after

807
01:02:44.000 --> 01:02:47.000
praying them on a daily basis,

808
01:02:47.000 --> 01:02:49.000
only because she was told.

809
01:02:49.000 --> 01:02:51.000
So she understands what she's doing,

810
01:02:51.000 --> 01:02:57.000
and it's this struggle of love, you know,

811
01:02:57.000 --> 01:02:59.000
that's actually going on.

812
01:02:59.000 --> 01:03:03.000
And this is why it's dangerous to read these on a surface level.

813
01:03:03.000 --> 01:03:04.000
You know?

814
01:03:04.000 --> 01:03:05.000
That is correct.

815
01:03:05.000 --> 01:03:07.000
If you surrender to God,

816
01:03:07.000 --> 01:03:10.000
he will surrender to you only one will.

817
01:03:10.000 --> 01:03:11.000
Is that correct?

818
01:03:11.000 --> 01:03:12.000
There's only one will, yeah.

819
01:03:12.000 --> 01:03:13.000
Yes, I'll have it correctly.

820
01:03:13.000 --> 01:03:15.000
Yeah, there's only one will.

821
01:03:15.000 --> 01:03:20.000
So when Louisa is saying to him,

822
01:03:20.000 --> 01:03:22.000
"I don't want you to do it,"

823
01:03:22.000 --> 01:03:24.000
he doesn't want to chastise,

824
01:03:24.000 --> 01:03:26.000
and he will explain that later.

825
01:03:26.000 --> 01:03:29.000
He doesn't want to chastise what he feels he has to do it.

826
01:03:29.000 --> 01:03:31.000
And when he says, "Let me do, let me do,"

827
01:03:31.000 --> 01:03:39.000
he's actually encouraging her to try and intercede more.

828
01:03:39.000 --> 01:03:43.000
Do you remember Abraham in Genesis chapter 18,

829
01:03:43.000 --> 01:03:45.000
interceding for Sodom?

830
01:03:45.000 --> 01:03:48.000
And, you know, when he got away with, you know,

831
01:03:48.000 --> 01:03:51.000
even if there's 50, then he tries 40.

832
01:03:51.000 --> 01:03:56.000
And God allows him to continue right down to one,

833
01:03:56.000 --> 01:03:57.000
to five or something.

834
01:03:57.000 --> 01:04:00.000
The five or five.

835
01:04:00.000 --> 01:04:05.000
It's to encourage him to intercede for the human race.

836
01:04:05.000 --> 01:04:08.000
That he needs intercessors on the earth.

837
01:04:08.000 --> 01:04:12.000
And so it's not actually disrespect for God.

838
01:04:12.000 --> 01:04:13.000
Is that okay?

839
01:04:13.000 --> 01:04:15.000
So let's read another.

840
01:04:15.000 --> 01:04:18.000
We'll go on for another 15 minutes.

841
01:04:18.000 --> 01:04:21.000
So, April the 26th,

842
01:04:21.000 --> 01:04:24.000
Jesus does not want to let her see the chastisement

843
01:04:24.000 --> 01:04:27.000
so as not to afflict her.

844
01:04:27.000 --> 01:04:30.000
Continuing in my poor state,

845
01:04:30.000 --> 01:04:33.000
I felt there were people around my bed

846
01:04:33.000 --> 01:04:35.000
who wanted me to see the chastisements

847
01:04:35.000 --> 01:04:37.000
which were happening in the world,

848
01:04:37.000 --> 01:04:40.000
earthquakes, wars, and many other things

849
01:04:40.000 --> 01:04:42.000
which I couldn't understand well,

850
01:04:42.000 --> 01:04:45.000
to make me intercede with the Lord.

851
01:04:45.000 --> 01:04:48.000
Now, you see the whole point, I'm showing this stuff

852
01:04:48.000 --> 01:04:50.000
to make me intercede.

853
01:04:50.000 --> 01:04:53.000
Now, our blessed mother told us in Medjugorje

854
01:04:53.000 --> 01:04:56.000
that if you would intercede, wars can be stopped

855
01:04:56.000 --> 01:04:59.000
and chastisements can be mitigated.

856
01:04:59.000 --> 01:05:01.000
See, that's the very reason why you're told

857
01:05:01.000 --> 01:05:03.000
what's going to happen.

858
01:05:03.000 --> 01:05:07.000
So, who are these people who are around her bed?

859
01:05:07.000 --> 01:05:09.000
It seemed to me that they were saints,

860
01:05:09.000 --> 01:05:11.000
but I can't tell with certainty.

861
01:05:11.000 --> 01:05:14.000
Okay? In the meantime,

862
01:05:14.000 --> 01:05:17.000
blessed Jesus came out from within my interior

863
01:05:17.000 --> 01:05:19.000
because that's where he's dwelling,

864
01:05:19.000 --> 01:05:21.000
and he said to them,

865
01:05:21.000 --> 01:05:23.000
"Do not molest her, do not afflict her

866
01:05:23.000 --> 01:05:26.000
by wanting to make her see sorrowful scenes."

867
01:05:26.000 --> 01:05:29.000
Here's Jesus defending Louisa.

868
01:05:29.000 --> 01:05:32.000
Now, if she had sinned against him

869
01:05:32.000 --> 01:05:34.000
in the last message,

870
01:05:34.000 --> 01:05:36.000
he wouldn't be defending her in this one.

871
01:05:36.000 --> 01:05:40.000
So, that's why you learn how to interpret

872
01:05:40.000 --> 01:05:43.000
what goes on as well.

873
01:05:43.000 --> 01:05:48.000
Rather, let her be tranquil and leave her alone with me.

874
01:05:48.000 --> 01:05:51.000
They went away, and I remained concerned.

875
01:05:51.000 --> 01:05:54.000
They went away. If they are saints coming from heaven,

876
01:05:54.000 --> 01:05:57.000
they will obey.

877
01:05:57.000 --> 01:06:00.000
If they're demons, they won't obey.

878
01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:02.000
They went away, and I remained concerned.

879
01:06:02.000 --> 01:06:04.000
Who knows what is happening,

880
01:06:04.000 --> 01:06:06.000
and he doesn't want me to see.

881
01:06:06.000 --> 01:06:09.000
Then afterwards, I found myself outside of myself

882
01:06:09.000 --> 01:06:12.000
and it goes into and out of the body experience, okay?

883
01:06:12.000 --> 01:06:16.000
And I saw a priest who began to talk about earthquakes

884
01:06:16.000 --> 01:06:19.000
which had occurred in the last few days,

885
01:06:19.000 --> 01:06:21.000
saying, "The Lord is very indignant.

886
01:06:21.000 --> 01:06:24.000
I believe that they're not yet finished."

887
01:06:24.000 --> 01:06:29.000
And Louisa said, "Who knows whether we will be spared."

888
01:06:29.000 --> 01:06:31.000
He became inflamed,

889
01:06:31.000 --> 01:06:33.000
and it seemed that his heart was beating

890
01:06:33.000 --> 01:06:35.000
so strongly that I could feel it myself,

891
01:06:35.000 --> 01:06:38.000
and those heartbeats would reverberate in my heart.

892
01:06:38.000 --> 01:06:41.000
I could not understand who he was,

893
01:06:41.000 --> 01:06:46.000
but I felt a certain something being communicated to me.

894
01:06:46.000 --> 01:06:50.000
So this priest that she meets in this out-of-the-body experience

895
01:06:50.000 --> 01:06:52.000
is obviously in heaven,

896
01:06:52.000 --> 01:06:58.000
is communicating to her that she should really intercede strongly.

897
01:06:58.000 --> 01:07:01.000
And he added, "How can grave things happen with destruction

898
01:07:01.000 --> 01:07:06.000
and dying of people where there is a heart that loves for all?"

899
01:07:06.000 --> 01:07:09.000
That's the bit he's trying to say to her,

900
01:07:09.000 --> 01:07:13.000
"If you really are in this relationship with God

901
01:07:13.000 --> 01:07:16.000
and you're in this union with God

902
01:07:16.000 --> 01:07:18.000
and you're in the divine will,

903
01:07:18.000 --> 01:07:21.000
surely you should be interceding for all."

904
01:07:21.000 --> 01:07:23.000
Now, there's one of the very basic things

905
01:07:23.000 --> 01:07:25.000
about living in the divine will.

906
01:07:25.000 --> 01:07:28.000
We don't live for ourselves, we don't pray for ourselves,

907
01:07:28.000 --> 01:07:31.000
we're only praying for everybody else.

908
01:07:31.000 --> 01:07:33.000
Everybody else, past, present and future.

909
01:07:33.000 --> 01:07:37.000
That's one of the "D" signs of a person in divine will.

910
01:07:37.000 --> 01:07:39.000
If you're praying for yourself,

911
01:07:39.000 --> 01:07:43.000
you still have to shift an awful lot.

912
01:07:43.000 --> 01:07:45.000
And then some people say, "Well,

913
01:07:45.000 --> 01:07:48.000
but if I don't pray for myself, well, what will happen to me?"

914
01:07:48.000 --> 01:07:51.000
And I say to them, "If you pray for everybody,

915
01:07:51.000 --> 01:07:55.000
past, present and future, you're included."

916
01:07:55.000 --> 01:07:59.000
If you're praying for all the dying, past, present and future,

917
01:07:59.000 --> 01:08:02.000
one of these days you'll be one of them.

918
01:08:02.000 --> 01:08:04.000
Is that okay?

919
01:08:04.000 --> 01:08:06.000
So, you're not left out,

920
01:08:06.000 --> 01:08:11.000
but you're asked in the divine will not to concentrate on yourself.

921
01:08:11.000 --> 01:08:12.000
Yeah.

922
01:08:12.000 --> 01:08:15.000
And I find it very liberating.

923
01:08:15.000 --> 01:08:16.000
Yeah.

924
01:08:16.000 --> 01:08:18.000
I find that and I find the nothingness.

925
01:08:18.000 --> 01:08:21.000
I love the nothingness in the divine will.

926
01:08:21.000 --> 01:08:24.000
To me, I say, "Lord, that was a brilliant idea."

927
01:08:24.000 --> 01:08:27.000
Because otherwise we'd be thinking of our faults and our failings

928
01:08:27.000 --> 01:08:29.000
and our struggles and our dis-sinner.

929
01:08:29.000 --> 01:08:32.000
That nowadays throw them all into the nothingness and say,

930
01:08:32.000 --> 01:08:33.000
"Here I am."

931
01:08:33.000 --> 01:08:34.000
It's brilliant.

932
01:08:34.000 --> 01:08:36.000
It's totally liberating.

933
01:08:36.000 --> 01:08:37.000
You know?

934
01:08:37.000 --> 01:08:38.000
It comes zero.

935
01:08:38.000 --> 01:08:39.000
Oh, yeah.

936
01:08:39.000 --> 01:08:41.000
But then he does everything.

937
01:08:41.000 --> 01:08:44.000
He says he creates from nothing.

938
01:08:44.000 --> 01:08:47.000
And that he loves creating from nothing.

939
01:08:47.000 --> 01:08:49.000
I say, "Here I am."

940
01:08:49.000 --> 01:08:51.000
It's wonderful.

941
01:08:51.000 --> 01:08:52.000
Yeah.

942
01:08:52.000 --> 01:08:55.000
And so there's one of the signs of a person living in the divine will

943
01:08:55.000 --> 01:09:00.000
that you intercede and you love for everybody.

944
01:09:00.000 --> 01:09:05.000
At most, a few tremors might be felt without considerable damage.

945
01:09:05.000 --> 01:09:07.000
So that's the earth shaking a little bit.

946
01:09:07.000 --> 01:09:11.000
So the next paragraph is all about loving for everybody else.

947
01:09:11.000 --> 01:09:13.000
If you want to put a heading on it.

948
01:09:13.000 --> 01:09:17.000
On hearing a heart that loves for all,

949
01:09:17.000 --> 01:09:21.000
I felt as though I were being picked on that lovely.

950
01:09:21.000 --> 01:09:25.000
And I myself cannot tell how I came out saying,

951
01:09:25.000 --> 01:09:28.000
"What are you saying a heart that loves for all?"

952
01:09:28.000 --> 01:09:32.000
Not only that loves for all, but that repairs for all,

953
01:09:32.000 --> 01:09:36.000
that suffers for all, that tanks for all, that praises for all,

954
01:09:36.000 --> 01:09:40.000
that adores for all, that respects the holy law for all.

955
01:09:40.000 --> 01:09:45.000
Now you know what living in the divine will is.

956
01:09:45.000 --> 01:09:50.000
So we do all of these things in the divine will for everybody.

957
01:09:50.000 --> 01:09:51.000
Okay.

958
01:09:51.000 --> 01:09:55.000
Now does that mean you have to say an awful lot of prayers?

959
01:09:55.000 --> 01:10:00.000
No, you can actually say to the Lord, "Look, I fuse in your divine will

960
01:10:00.000 --> 01:10:03.000
and I want to literally pick it up.

961
01:10:03.000 --> 01:10:07.000
I want to adore, praise, bless, honor, worship, tank, and praise you

962
01:10:07.000 --> 01:10:11.000
on behalf of all souls, past, present and futures, all over and done.

963
01:10:11.000 --> 01:10:15.000
And I want to multiply it to infinity for an infinitude of time."

964
01:10:15.000 --> 01:10:18.000
That's it.

965
01:10:18.000 --> 01:10:20.000
You've said it forever.

966
01:10:20.000 --> 01:10:22.000
Is that okay?

967
01:10:22.000 --> 01:10:25.000
So while you're asked to do an awful lot in the divine will,

968
01:10:25.000 --> 01:10:28.000
it doesn't take up an infinitude of space.

969
01:10:28.000 --> 01:10:31.000
The prayers in the divine will are actually quite short.

970
01:10:31.000 --> 01:10:36.000
What it means is locking into the divine will and just saying,

971
01:10:36.000 --> 01:10:40.000
"If this is what you want, I'll do it in the divine will and he does it."

972
01:10:40.000 --> 01:10:41.000
Is that okay?

973
01:10:41.000 --> 01:10:46.000
So you don't need long, long, long prayers.

974
01:10:46.000 --> 01:10:48.000
So the heart that loves for all.

975
01:10:48.000 --> 01:10:52.000
Because I do not believe it is true love towards the beloved.

976
01:10:52.000 --> 01:10:57.000
If it does not render him the love and all the satisfaction

977
01:10:57.000 --> 01:11:00.000
which the others are supposed to render him.

978
01:11:00.000 --> 01:11:02.000
Okay?

979
01:11:02.000 --> 01:11:05.000
So she says it isn't true love for the Lord.

980
01:11:05.000 --> 01:11:10.000
If we don't offer him love and satisfaction for all that other people

981
01:11:10.000 --> 01:11:11.000
should be doing.

982
01:11:11.000 --> 01:11:15.000
Now you see, the more we do this for other people,

983
01:11:15.000 --> 01:11:18.000
the more these people will be saved.

984
01:11:18.000 --> 01:11:20.000
Okay?

985
01:11:20.000 --> 01:11:25.000
In such a way that in that person he will find all the good

986
01:11:25.000 --> 01:11:30.000
and contentment which he was to find in everybody.

987
01:11:30.000 --> 01:11:34.000
On hearing me he became more ignited and drew near me

988
01:11:34.000 --> 01:11:36.000
in the act of wanting to clasp me.

989
01:11:36.000 --> 01:11:37.000
I was afraid.

990
01:11:37.000 --> 01:11:41.000
I felt blushing for having spoken that way and my heart struck

991
01:11:41.000 --> 01:11:44.000
by his heartbeats was throbbing.

992
01:11:44.000 --> 01:11:48.000
He seemed to transform as if he were the Lord.

993
01:11:48.000 --> 01:11:50.000
But I cannot tell with certainty.

994
01:11:50.000 --> 01:11:53.000
Without my being able to oppose him he clasped me to himself.

995
01:11:53.000 --> 01:11:57.000
It was the Lord telling me every morning I will come to you

996
01:11:57.000 --> 01:12:00.000
and we will have breakfast together.

997
01:12:00.000 --> 01:12:02.000
Isn't that wonderful?

998
01:12:02.000 --> 01:12:05.000
I once had a friend who has long since in heaven

999
01:12:05.000 --> 01:12:07.000
probably smiling at me remembering her.

1000
01:12:07.000 --> 01:12:09.000
I only ever knew her as nanny.

1001
01:12:09.000 --> 01:12:13.000
If she was dead before I really got the name.

1002
01:12:13.000 --> 01:12:16.000
But she had a most wonderful experience of Jesus.

1003
01:12:16.000 --> 01:12:19.000
She went to Mass every day of her life.

1004
01:12:19.000 --> 01:12:21.000
Hail rain or snow.

1005
01:12:21.000 --> 01:12:24.000
And one morning she was going to six o'clock Mass in the morning

1006
01:12:24.000 --> 01:12:27.000
in the days where you could get that.

1007
01:12:27.000 --> 01:12:31.000
And she said, "Lord, I always believed in your presence

1008
01:12:31.000 --> 01:12:32.000
in the Holy Euch.

1009
01:12:32.000 --> 01:12:33.000
But today I don't.

1010
01:12:33.000 --> 01:12:36.000
Today I'm going to have to tell me yourself."

1011
01:12:36.000 --> 01:12:38.000
And she said, "I have no idea why I did it."

1012
01:12:38.000 --> 01:12:40.000
But she said, "That's what happened."

1013
01:12:40.000 --> 01:12:42.000
She went down to Mass and she was waiting all the time

1014
01:12:42.000 --> 01:12:45.000
for the Lord to say something to her.

1015
01:12:45.000 --> 01:12:47.000
And the whole thing was perfectly normal.

1016
01:12:47.000 --> 01:12:49.000
And she got to get more and more agitated.

1017
01:12:49.000 --> 01:12:51.000
And she was saying to the Lord,

1018
01:12:51.000 --> 01:12:54.000
"You're supposed to respond, you know."

1019
01:12:54.000 --> 01:12:56.000
And then she went up to the Holy Communion.

1020
01:12:56.000 --> 01:12:57.000
Nothing happened.

1021
01:12:57.000 --> 01:12:59.000
Then she came back and she was really upset.

1022
01:12:59.000 --> 01:13:00.000
And she put her head down.

1023
01:13:00.000 --> 01:13:02.000
She said, "You have let me down."

1024
01:13:02.000 --> 01:13:04.000
And he said, "Look up."

1025
01:13:04.000 --> 01:13:05.000
And she looked up.

1026
01:13:05.000 --> 01:13:07.000
And instead of the priest, she saw Jesus.

1027
01:13:07.000 --> 01:13:11.000
And Jesus was holding the pattern and the chalice.

1028
01:13:11.000 --> 01:13:15.000
And he said, "Nanny, this is your soul's breakfast."

1029
01:13:15.000 --> 01:13:18.000
And she said, "Exactly the language that is used here.

1030
01:13:18.000 --> 01:13:20.000
This is your soul's breakfast."

1031
01:13:20.000 --> 01:13:24.000
And I tried to get out of her, you know,

1032
01:13:24.000 --> 01:13:25.000
of what happened to her.

1033
01:13:25.000 --> 01:13:27.000
She said, "I couldn't tell you what happened to me."

1034
01:13:27.000 --> 01:13:29.000
"All I can tell you," she said,

1035
01:13:29.000 --> 01:13:32.000
"Is that why horses wouldn't keep me away?"

1036
01:13:32.000 --> 01:13:33.000
Yeah.

1037
01:13:33.000 --> 01:13:36.000
And when it came to her dying,

1038
01:13:36.000 --> 01:13:39.000
she was diagnosed with terminal cancer.

1039
01:13:39.000 --> 01:13:41.000
As soon as she heard it was terminal,

1040
01:13:41.000 --> 01:13:43.000
she said to the doctor, "Right, I'm going home now."

1041
01:13:43.000 --> 01:13:45.000
He said, "No, no, no, you need all kinds of..."

1042
01:13:45.000 --> 01:13:49.000
She said, "If you tell me it's terminal, I need nothing."

1043
01:13:49.000 --> 01:13:54.000
She said, "The doctor said what will you do?"

1044
01:13:54.000 --> 01:13:59.000
She said, "This is my opportunity to participate in the Passion of Christ."

1045
01:13:59.000 --> 01:14:01.000
And that day till the day she died,

1046
01:14:01.000 --> 01:14:05.000
she never once said she was in pain or distress.

1047
01:14:05.000 --> 01:14:09.000
Never once she took no tablet,

1048
01:14:09.000 --> 01:14:13.000
saw no doctor and no nurse.

1049
01:14:13.000 --> 01:14:15.000
And she was absolutely radiant.

1050
01:14:15.000 --> 01:14:17.000
She said, "This is my opportunity."

1051
01:14:17.000 --> 01:14:19.000
You see, the way what has happened to Louisa,

1052
01:14:19.000 --> 01:14:21.000
other people have had touches of it.

1053
01:14:21.000 --> 01:14:25.000
That person was in this country,

1054
01:14:25.000 --> 01:14:28.000
not incredibly far from here.

1055
01:14:28.000 --> 01:14:31.000
And that's my joy when I meet

1056
01:14:31.000 --> 01:14:35.000
that little bits of this in people I actually know,

1057
01:14:35.000 --> 01:14:37.000
to know what I mean.

1058
01:14:37.000 --> 01:14:39.000
And if you keep your ear to the ground,

1059
01:14:39.000 --> 01:14:43.000
you'll probably find little bits of it in people

1060
01:14:43.000 --> 01:14:45.000
in a most amazing way.

1061
01:14:45.000 --> 01:14:47.000
That's why I wanted to tell you that story,

1062
01:14:47.000 --> 01:14:49.000
because it was exactly the same expression

1063
01:14:49.000 --> 01:14:51.000
that Holy Communion is your soul's breakfast.

1064
01:14:51.000 --> 01:14:53.000
Is that okay?

1065
01:14:53.000 --> 01:14:57.000
I'll just do one more and then we'll finish

1066
01:14:57.000 --> 01:15:01.000
this evening. So April the 29th,

1067
01:15:01.000 --> 01:15:03.000
how the soul who is empty of everything

1068
01:15:03.000 --> 01:15:05.000
is like water that always runs.

1069
01:15:05.000 --> 01:15:07.000
Continuing in my usual state,

1070
01:15:07.000 --> 01:15:09.000
Blessed Jesus came for just a little,

1071
01:15:09.000 --> 01:15:13.000
and filling all of my interior with himself,

1072
01:15:13.000 --> 01:15:17.000
he told me, "My daughter, an empty soul."

1073
01:15:17.000 --> 01:15:19.000
Now, there's you in your nothingness.

1074
01:15:19.000 --> 01:15:22.000
It's like water that runs and always runs,

1075
01:15:22.000 --> 01:15:25.000
and when it reaches the center from which it came,

1076
01:15:25.000 --> 01:15:27.000
only then does it stop.

1077
01:15:27.000 --> 01:15:29.000
And since water has no color,

1078
01:15:29.000 --> 01:15:33.000
it receives into itself all the colors that are reflected in it.

1079
01:15:33.000 --> 01:15:35.000
You see that with the sea,

1080
01:15:35.000 --> 01:15:37.000
when you see that beautiful blue color on it,

1081
01:15:37.000 --> 01:15:41.000
or that desperate, dark green color, or the gray color,

1082
01:15:41.000 --> 01:15:43.000
you know exactly how you feel about it.

1083
01:15:43.000 --> 01:15:47.000
In the same way, the empty soul runs

1084
01:15:47.000 --> 01:15:51.000
and always runs towards the divine center from which she came.

1085
01:15:51.000 --> 01:15:55.000
And when she comes to fill all of herself

1086
01:15:55.000 --> 01:15:57.000
completely with God,

1087
01:15:57.000 --> 01:15:59.000
and also you have to be empty to be completely filled.

1088
01:15:59.000 --> 01:16:03.000
Only then does she stop.

1089
01:16:03.000 --> 01:16:05.000
In fact, since she is empty,

1090
01:16:05.000 --> 01:16:09.000
nothing of the divine being escapes her.

1091
01:16:09.000 --> 01:16:11.000
Would you want to run that in green, white, and gold?

1092
01:16:11.000 --> 01:16:16.000
Isn't it fantastic? Nothing of the divine being.

1093
01:16:16.000 --> 01:16:18.000
And that's why in one of the higher volumes,

1094
01:16:18.000 --> 01:16:22.000
I think this time it was Volume 23,

1095
01:16:22.000 --> 01:16:24.000
where Jesus was talking about something,

1096
01:16:24.000 --> 01:16:26.000
and then he said,

1097
01:16:26.000 --> 01:16:28.000
"But your nothingness has to be really empty."

1098
01:16:28.000 --> 01:16:32.000
We are not burst out laughing when we read this,

1099
01:16:32.000 --> 01:16:35.000
because surely nothingness is empty.

1100
01:16:35.000 --> 01:16:39.000
But knowing us, you can fill it with just a little bit, you know?

1101
01:16:39.000 --> 01:16:42.000
Your nothingness must be really empty.

1102
01:16:42.000 --> 01:16:44.000
So if you are really empty,

1103
01:16:44.000 --> 01:16:47.000
then the whole of the divine being can be poured into you.

1104
01:16:47.000 --> 01:16:50.000
And since she does not have a color of her own,

1105
01:16:50.000 --> 01:16:55.000
she receives all the divine colors well into herself.

1106
01:16:55.000 --> 01:16:57.000
Now only an empty soul,

1107
01:16:57.000 --> 01:17:00.000
because she is empty of everything,

1108
01:17:00.000 --> 01:17:04.000
understands things according to the truth.

1109
01:17:04.000 --> 01:17:06.000
Now look at that.

1110
01:17:06.000 --> 01:17:09.000
In other words, you are not being deceived

1111
01:17:09.000 --> 01:17:13.000
by the empty ideas of the world.

1112
01:17:13.000 --> 01:17:16.000
Okay? You can see them according to truth.

1113
01:17:16.000 --> 01:17:19.000
You can see the preciousness of suffering.

1114
01:17:19.000 --> 01:17:23.000
You can see the true good of virtue.

1115
01:17:23.000 --> 01:17:27.000
You can see the necessity for the eternal one alone,

1116
01:17:27.000 --> 01:17:29.000
because in order to love something,

1117
01:17:29.000 --> 01:17:32.000
it's absolutely necessary to hate

1118
01:17:32.000 --> 01:17:35.000
that which is opposite to what is loved.

1119
01:17:35.000 --> 01:17:39.000
Love and hate doesn't mean the sinful hate.

1120
01:17:39.000 --> 01:17:43.000
It means that you will reject completely, okay?

1121
01:17:43.000 --> 01:17:47.000
Only an empty soul reaches such great happiness.

1122
01:17:47.000 --> 01:17:49.000
That's a good place to stop, isn't it?
